<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116234" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠμόφᾰγ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>eating raw flesh,
				carnivorous,</i> of savage beasts, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέοντες, θῶες, λύκοι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.782
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.479
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.157
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῆρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ven.</u>
					124
				</span></i>
			; of the Centaurs, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				542
			</span></i>; of savage men, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				1.13
			</span></i>; of certain daemons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠμοφάγοι χθόνιοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.1444
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὠ.</span>”
				<i>carnivores,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					2.49
				</span></i>
			 cod.M, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				608b25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				694a1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠ. χάρις</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδροβρώς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				139
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			rarely proparox. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠμόφᾰγος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>eaten raw,</i> of sacrifices offered to Dionysus,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				472.12
			</span></i> (anap., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάς τ᾽ ὠμοφάγους δαίτας
				τελέσας</span> codd. perh. rightly, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠμοφάγιον</span>).</div>
